1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,180
Two seconds to midnight.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,230
Your phone is about to delete your little

3
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:05,900
brother.

4
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:08,505
In this world, every midnight, your

5
00:00:08,525 --> 00:00:10,455
phone deletes the contact you haven't

6
00:00:10,475 --> 00:00:12,045
called the longest.

7
00:00:12,065 --> 00:00:13,346
Gone for good.

8
00:00:13,366 --> 00:00:15,010
You can't save it again.

9
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,610
Texts don't count.

10
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:19,200
Only a call, answered before midnight.

11
00:00:21,049 --> 00:00:23,154
Last month it took Coach Ray.

12
00:00:23,174 --> 00:00:24,769
Then your old friend Sam.

13
00:00:24,789 --> 00:00:26,495
You didn't even notice.

14
00:00:26,515 --> 00:00:29,065
Tonight, the name at the top is Theo.

15
00:00:29,085 --> 00:00:30,036
Thirty days.

16
00:00:30,056 --> 00:00:31,586
Which is strange.

17
00:00:31,606 --> 00:00:33,226
Theo lives in your flat.

18
00:00:33,246 --> 00:00:34,651
He's in the next room.

19
00:00:34,671 --> 00:00:35,613
Right now.

20
00:00:37,263 --> 00:00:38,513
You text him a meme.

21
00:00:38,533 --> 00:00:39,803
Texts don't count.

22
00:00:39,823 --> 00:00:40,678
You knock.

23
00:00:40,698 --> 00:00:42,529
He has his headphones on.

24
00:00:42,549 --> 00:00:43,964
Twenty-three fifty-eight.

25
00:00:43,984 --> 00:00:45,779
There's only one way left.

26
00:00:45,799 --> 00:00:47,229
You have to call your brother.

27
00:00:47,249 --> 00:00:48,844
Who is eight steps away.

28
00:00:48,864 --> 00:00:49,934
You press call.

29
00:00:49,954 --> 00:00:52,943
In the next room, his phone is on silent.

30
00:00:54,193 --> 00:00:55,950
So you bang on the wall.

31
00:00:55,970 --> 00:00:56,770
What?!

32
00:00:56,790 --> 00:00:58,124
Pick up your phone!

33
00:00:58,144 --> 00:00:59,663
You're literally right there!

34
00:00:59,683 --> 00:01:00,898
Just pick up!

35
00:01:01,048 --> 00:01:03,378
He picks up at twenty-three fifty-nine

36
00:01:03,398 --> 00:01:04,898
and fifty-one seconds.

37
00:01:04,918 --> 00:01:05,669
Hello?

38
00:01:05,689 --> 00:01:06,019
Hi.

39
00:01:06,039 --> 00:01:06,866
It's me.

40
00:01:06,886 --> 00:01:07,641
I know it's you.

41
00:01:07,661 --> 00:01:08,973
Why are we doing this?

42
00:01:09,523 --> 00:01:10,723
Midnight comes.

43
00:01:10,743 --> 00:01:12,323
Someone else gets deleted.

44
00:01:12,343 --> 00:01:13,563
Not Theo.

45
00:01:13,583 --> 00:01:15,463
You stay on the phone for an hour.

46
00:01:15,483 --> 00:01:16,658
Through a wall.

47
00:01:16,678 --> 00:01:18,499
Who haven't you called in a while?
